erm) of this action.'}, {'subject': 'canUndertakeNow', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'Cloth', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'vêtement'}, {'subject': 'taskOfPlan', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'cyc:Color', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'colour'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Clock', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'Artifact'}, {'subject': 'experiences', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'vit'}, {'subject': 'cyc:PurposefulAction', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'cyc:EdibleStuff', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'cyc:PartiallyTangible'}, {'subject': 'receivedBy', 'predicate': 'rdfs:comment', 'object': 'Link an action to the object or agent that is a recipient of the action result.\nNot to be confused with actionOnObject that denote that the object is the main concern of the action.\n\nExample: John got >Mary< a present.'}, {'subject': 'cyc:inFrontOf-Generally', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:ObjectProperty'}, {'subject': 'Navigation', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'cyc:Action'}, {'subject': 'Human', 'predicate': 'openCycUri', 'object': 'http://sw.opencyc.org/concept/Mx4rvViAkpwpEbGdrcN5Y29ycA'}, {'subject': 'Avatar', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'foaf:Agent'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Remote_control', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'remote'}, {'subject': 'disengaged', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'Shape', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Class'}, {'subject': 'hasEngagementLevel', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:ObjectProperty'}, {'subject': 'cyc:SoftDrink', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'NonAlcoholicBeverage'}, {'subject': 'recipientOfAction', 'predicate': 'rdfs:comment', 'object': 'When relevant for the considered action, this property specify the agent or object whose state is eventually modified as a *result* of an action. It is not be the object of action itself (specified by the "objectOfAction" property).\n\nFor instance, in the sentence "The robot gives the cup to the human", the human is the final recipient of the cup and hence the recipientOfAction. In the sentence "I place the robot on the chair", the chair is the recipient of action while the robot is the object of the action. In the sentence "Jido shows the Eiffel tower to the tourist", the recipient is the tourist and the object of action is the Eiffel tower.'}, {'subject': 'sitting', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'assi'}, {'subject': 'sees', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'voit'}, {'subject': 'startsAfterEndingOf', 'predicate': 'rdfs:domain', 'object': 'cyc:TemporalThing'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Fork', 'predicate': 'cocoClass', 'object': 'fork'}, {'subject': 'leftOf', 'predicate': 'owl:inverseOf', 'object': 'rightOf'}, {'subject': 'cyc:StaticSituation', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'situation statique'}, {'subject': 'Torso', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'torse'}, {'subject': 'isTraversable', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:DatatypeProperty'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Smartphone', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'LeftHand', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'actionInvolves', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subPropertyOf', 'object': 'involves'}, {'subject': 'taskOfPlan', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'is a task of plan'}, {'subject': 'mainColorOfObject', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'has main color'}, {'subject': 'black', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'cyc:Color'}, {'subject': 'cyc:Food', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'focusesOn', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'focuses on'}, {'subject': 'current_world_state', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'cyc:Situation'}, {'subject': 'actsOnObject', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'objectOfAction', 'predicate': 'rdfs:range', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'isAbove', '