erm) of this action.'}, {'subject': 'canUndertakeNow', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'Cloth', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'vêtement'}, {'subject': 'taskOfPlan', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'cyc:Color', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'colour'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Clock', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'Artifact'}, {'subject': 'experiences', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'vit'}, {'subject': 'cyc:PurposefulAction', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'cyc:EdibleStuff', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'cyc:PartiallyTangible'}, {'subject': 'receivedBy', 'predicate': 'rdfs:comment', 'object': 'Link an action to the object or agent that is a recipient of the action result.\nNot to be confused with actionOnObject that denote that the object is the main concern of the action.\n\nExample: John got >Mary< a present.'}, {'subject': 'cyc:inFrontOf-Generally', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:ObjectProperty'}, {'subject': 'Navigation', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'cyc:Action'}, {'subject': 'Human', 'predicate': 'openCycUri', 'object': 'http://sw.opencyc.org/concept/Mx4rvViAkpwpEbGdrcN5Y29ycA'}, {'subject': 'Avatar', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'foaf:Agent'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Remote_control', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'remote'}, {'subject': 'disengaged', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'Shape', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Class'}, {'subject': 'hasEngagementLevel', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:ObjectProperty'}, {'subject': 'cyc:SoftDrink', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'NonAlcoholicBeverage'}, {'subject': 'recipientOfAction', 'predicate': 'rdfs:comment', 'object': 'When relevant for the considered action, this property specify the agent or object whose state is eventually modified as a *result* of an action. It is not be the object of action itse