the phase space of some physical system (e.g.) might not be. If the intent is to imply location in the empirically observable cosmos, the user should employ this collection's specialization, SpatialThing-Localized."}, {'subject': 'hasThematicRoleRelationWith', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:ObjectProperty'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Table_(furniture)', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Class'}, {'subject': 'cyc:FurniturePiece', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'meuble'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Clock', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'clock'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Smartphone', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Class'}, {'subject': 'cyc:SpatialThing', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'Idling', 'predicate': 'rdfs:comment', 'object': "A type of Resting-Relaxing action where the agent is 'doing nothing'."}, {'subject': 'cyc:Food', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Class'}, {'subject': 'currentlyDoes', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Ball', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'ballon'}, {'subject': 'TaskPlan', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'plan'}, {'subject': 'EngagementSituation', 'predicate': 'rdfs:comment', 'object': 'Situation where two or more agents are engaging into joint activity(ies). These activities can by concrete (playing a game together, participating into a phone call,...) or more abstract (eg joint attention).\n\nImportantly, while EngagementSituation is inherently a shared experience between agent, each agent experiences its own, idenpendent, EngagementSituation. As such, only one Agent should experience a given instance of EngagementSituation.\n\nThe joint engagement between two (or more) agents is then expressed via the predicate jointEngagementWith, that operates between instances of EngagementSituation.'}, {'subject': 'EligibleAction', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subClassOf', 'object': 'cyc:Action'}, {'subject': 'rdfs:label', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}