lf (specified by the "objectOfAction" property).\n\nFor instance, in the sentence "The robot gives the cup to the human", the human is the final recipient of the cup and hence the recipientOfAction. In the sentence "I place the robot on the chair", the chair is the recipient of action while the robot is the object of the action. In the sentence "Jido shows the Eiffel tower to the tourist", the recipient is the tourist and the object of action is the Eiffel tower.'}, {'subject': 'sitting', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'assi'}, {'subject': 'sees', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'voit'}, {'subject': 'startsAfterEndingOf', 'predicate': 'rdfs:domain', 'object': 'cyc:TemporalThing'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Fork', 'predicate': 'cocoClass', 'object': 'fork'}, {'subject': 'leftOf', 'predicate': 'owl:inverseOf', 'object': 'rightOf'}, {'subject': 'cyc:StaticSituation', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'situation statique'}, {'subject': 'Torso', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'torse'}, {'subject': 'isTraversable', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:DatatypeProperty'}, {'subject': 'dbr:Smartphone', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'LeftHand', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'actionInvolves', 'predicate': 'rdfs:subPropertyOf', 'object': 'involves'}, {'subject': 'taskOfPlan', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'is a task of plan'}, {'subject': 'mainColorOfObject', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'has main color'}, {'subject': 'black', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'cyc:Color'}, {'subject': 'cyc:Food', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'focusesOn', 'predicate': 'rdfs:label', 'object': 'focuses on'}, {'subject': 'current_world_state', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'cyc:Situation'}, {'subject': 'actsOnObject', 'predicate': 'rdf:type', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'objectOfAction', 'predicate': 'rdfs:range', 'object': 'owl:Thing'}, {'subject': 'isAbove', '